# Package Manager

The root workspace uses **pnpm**. The desktop app in `desktop-vue2/` is excluded and uses **Yarn Classic**. Muya remains in the pnpm workspace.

- Run installation from the repository root with `pnpm install`.
- In `desktop-vue2/`, use `corepack yarn install --frozen-lockfile` and `corepack yarn add <pkg>` / `corepack yarn add -D <pkg>`. The app links to Muya with `link:../libs-muya`.
- Use `pnpm --filter libs-muya add <pkg>` / `pnpm --filter libs-muya add -D <pkg>` for the Muya package.
- Run workspace scripts with `pnpm --filter <package-name> <script>`. The root desktop scripts forward to Yarn.
